胤夷滅，夫人父牧，以疏遠徙邊郡。孫休即位，大赦，得還，以牧為五官中郎。皓既封烏程侯，聘牧女為妃。皓即位，立為皇后，封牧高密侯，拜衛將軍，錄尚書事。後朝士以牧尊戚，頗推令諫爭。而夫人寵漸衰，皓滋不悅，皓母何恆左右之。又太史言，於運歷，后不可易，皓信巫覡，故得不廢，常供養昇平宮。牧見遣居蒼梧郡，雖爵位不奪，其實裔也，遂道路憂死。長秋官僚，備員而已，受朝賀表疏如故。而皓內諸寵姬，佩皇后璽紱者多矣。天紀四年，隨皓遷於洛陽。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-teng:line062:m0001","start":1,"end":2,"surface":"皓","kind":"person","person_id":"05e_9bb_55a","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-teng:line062:m0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"滕夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"e1z_w57_m3h_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-teng:line062:m0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"胤","kind":"person","person_id":"wgt_wdg_vkv","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-teng:line062:m0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"胤","kind":"person","person_id":"wgt_wdg_vkv","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-teng:line062:m0022","start":22,"end":23,"surface":"牧","kind":"person","person_id":"e1z_w57_m3h","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-teng:line062:m0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"孫休","kind":"person","person_id":"0fo_c5c_4yh","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-teng:line062:m0043","start":43,"end":44,"surface":"牧","kind":"person","person_id":"e1z_w57_m3h","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-teng:line062:m0050","start":50,"end":51,"surface":"皓","kind":"person","person_id":"05e_9bb_55a","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-teng:line062:m0058","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"牧","kind":"person","person_id":"e1z_w57_m3h","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-ten